            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "21 or higher becomes available to be filled on a permanent basis, employees holding permanent status in the classification who have requested reassignment to the location of the available vacancy shall be considered for such position and notified. Employees may upon notification rescind their request for reassignment. Employees who rescind their request after selection may not request reassignment for a period of one year. In the event that there is a civil service certified list available for such permanent vacancy, applicants appearing on such certified list may be considered in conjunction with those applicants seeking reassignment and such selection shall be based on the following factors in priority:",
